  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "把文件拖进 DSH,AI 就能读",
      "text": "**⭐ 支持拖拽上传&ensp;·&ensp;⭐ 支持远程上传&ensp;·&ensp;⭐ 任意格式附件**\n\n部署在服务器上的 DSH,也能像本地一样,拖了就发\n\n[English](README.en.md)&ensp;·&ensp;[AI 版本](README.ai.md)&ensp;·&ensp;[更新日志](CHANGELOG.md)\n\n[](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/)\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/in-chat.png\" alt=\"附件随消息发出,AI 直接读取文件内容\" width=\"880\">\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 亮点",
      "text": "- 🖱️ **拖进来就行**——文件、整个文件夹,拖到窗口任意位置,松手即传\n- 🌐 **远程也好用**——DSH 装在服务器上?通过 SSH 隧道访问,传文件和本地一模一样\n- 📎 **不挑格式**——图片、视频、音频、PDF、压缩包、代码文件……任何文件都能传\n- 👀 **先看再发**——发送前在浏览器里直接预览:图片放大看,视频拖进度条,音频直接播\n- 💬 **原生体验**——附件卡片与聊天气泡对齐,点平常见的发送按钮即可,AI 自动读取文件内容\n- 🔒 **各管各的**——文件只落在当前会话的工作区,会话之间互相隔离"
    },
    {
      "section": "🖼️ 看一看",
      "text": "| 拖进来 | 发出去 | 随时预览 |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/drop-in.png\" alt=\"拖入文件后显示附件卡片\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/in-chat.png\" alt=\"附件随消息发出,AI 读取内容\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/preview-modal.png\" alt=\"浏览器内预览附件\"> |\n| 拖到窗口任意位置,卡片立刻出现 | 附件跟着消息走,AI 直接读内容 | 点开就能预览,还能下载 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 三分钟上手",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-airdrop\ndsh web\n```\n\n> 重启 `dsh web` 生效;会话需要有工作区目录。从 0.2.1 起包名与仓库统一为 `dsh-airdrop`(旧名 `dsh-universal-attachments` 已停用);历史会话里的附件卡片与磁盘数据仍按旧格式读取,无需迁移。\n\n<details>\n<summary>想从源码构建?</summary>\n\n```powershell\npnpm install\npnpm run build\npnpm pack\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\\dsh-airdrop-0.2.1.tgz\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "❓ 可能会问",
      "text": "**大文件能传吗?**\n能。文件分块上传,网络断了自动续传;网关嫌块太大(返回 413)时会自动调小重试。单文件上限 20 GiB。\n\n**支持哪些格式?**\n全部。不按格式拒绝任何文件。\"任意格式\"指不拦截字节内容,不代表 AI 一定能读懂每种格式;插件也不会自己去执行或解压你的文件。\n\n**空文件夹会一起传吗?**\n浏览器一般不报告空目录,所以完全空的文件夹可能不会被保留。\n\n**开多个标签页会怎样?**\n同一会话的多个标签页共享一份待发送附件,谁先点发送,谁就带走当时已传完的文件。\n\n**想清理空间怎么办?**\n先停掉 DSH,然后只删除该插件对应的会话目录和它的元数据文件(`.dsh/uploads/.universal-attachments/<会话标识>.json`)。不要整个删掉 `.dsh/uploads/`,历史附件链接会失效。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🛡️ 要放到服务器上?",
      "text": "DSH 没有内建的多用户认证,别直接暴露到公网。让它只监听服务器本机,用 SSH 隧道访问:\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器上",
      "text": "dsh web --port 3080"
    },
    {
      "section": "你的电脑上",
      "text": "ssh -L 3080:127.0.0.1:3080 user@你的服务器\n```\n\n然后在本机浏览器打开 `http://127.0.0.1:3080` 即可。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Drop a file into DSH, and the agent can read it",
      "text": "**⭐ Drag-and-drop uploads&ensp;·&ensp;⭐ Remote-friendly&ensp;·&ensp;⭐ Any file type**\n\nEven when DSH runs on a remote server, dropping a file works exactly like it does on localhost\n\n[简体中文](README.md)&ensp;·&ensp;[AI version](README.ai.md)&ensp;·&ensp;[Changelog](CHANGELOG.md)\n\n[](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Drop a file into DSH, and the agent can read it",
      "text": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/in-chat.png\" alt=\"The attachment goes out with the message and the agent reads it\" width=\"880\">\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ Highlights",
      "text": "- 🖱️ **Just drop it** — files or whole folders, anywhere in the window; release and they upload\n- 🌐 **Remote-friendly** — DSH on a server? Over an SSH tunnel, uploading feels exactly like local\n- 📎 **No format filter** — images, video, audio, PDFs, archives, code… anything uploads\n- 👀 **Preview before you send** — right in the browser: zoom into images, scrub video, play audio\n- 💬 **Feels native** — attachment cards align with your chat bubbles and go out with the ordinary send button; the agent reads the file contents itself\n- 🔒 **Isolated per session** — files land in the current session's workspace only; sessions never see each other's uploads"
    },
    {
      "section": "🖼️ Take a look",
      "text": "| Drop it in | Send it off | Preview anytime |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/drop-in.png\" alt=\"A card appears the moment you drop a file\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/in-chat.png\" alt=\"The attachment rides along with the message\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/demacia1314/dsh-airdrop/main/assets/preview-modal.png\" alt=\"In-browser attachment preview\"> |\n| Drop anywhere — a card appears instantly | The attachment rides with your message, and the agent reads it | One click to preview, with download |"
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Up and running in three minutes",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-airdrop\ndsh web\n```\n\n> Restart `dsh web` after installing, and make sure the session has a workspace directory. Naming note: as of 0.2.1 the package is `dsh-airdrop`, matching the repo (the old `dsh-universal-attachments` name is retired); existing sessions' attachment cards and on-disk data keep loading unchanged.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Prefer building from source?</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Up and running in three minutes",
      "text": "```powershell\npnpm install\npnpm run build\npnpm pack\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\\dsh-airdrop-0.2.1.tgz\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "❓ You might ask",
      "text": "**Can it handle big files?**\nYes. Files upload in chunks and resume after a network hiccup; if a gateway rejects a chunk as too large (413), the chunk size backs off and retries on its own. Up to 20 GiB per file.\n\n**Which formats are supported?**\nAll of them — nothing is rejected by file type. \"Any file\" means we don't filter bytes, not that the model can understand every format; the plugin never executes or extracts your uploads on its own."
    },
    {
      "section": "❓ You might ask",
      "text": "**Do empty folders come along?**\nBrowsers generally don't report empty directories, so a completely empty folder may not be preserved.\n\n**What about multiple tabs?**\nTabs on the same session share one pending-attachment draft; whichever tab sends first takes the files that are ready at that moment."
    },
    {
      "section": "❓ You might ask",
      "text": "**How do I reclaim disk space?**\nStop DSH, then delete only this plugin's session directory and its metadata file (`.dsh/uploads/.universal-attachments/<session-id>.json`). Don't wipe the whole `.dsh/uploads/` tree — history links would stop working."
    },
    {
      "section": "🛡️ Running it on a server?",
      "text": "DSH has no built-in multi-user authentication, so don't expose it to the public internet. Bind it to loopback and reach it through an SSH tunnel:\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "on the server",
      "text": "dsh web --port 3080"
    },
    {
      "section": "on your machine",
      "text": "ssh -L 3080:127.0.0.1:3080 user@your-server\n```\n\nThen open `http://127.0.0.1:3080` in your local browser."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
